    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/f19b4256a0c91b6a17b4455a545e2a83.poster.avif?t=1754841595\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/f19b4256a0c91b6a17b4455a545e2a83.webm?t=1754841595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/f19b4256a0c91b6a17b4455a545e2a83.mp4?t=1754841595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sunset Inferno is a narrative adventure RPG set in a city rotting from within. You are The Recycler, a machine with an identity crisis. Uncover why you were made, and decide what happens when that truth comes calling.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bomb explodes on the highway. A truck flips. You fall out: a machine built for a purpose you can barely remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who built you? Who broke you?</strong>\u00a0<strong><i>What</i> are you?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/bb8e53dfadd65b2dbfc4db7724de2892.poster.avif?t=1754841595\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/bb8e53dfadd65b2dbfc4db7724de2892.webm?t=1754841595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/bb8e53dfadd65b2dbfc4db7724de2892.mp4?t=1754841595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you walk the streets of an unfamiliar city, something stirring inside you: <i>doubt</i>. And far below, beneath layers of concrete and iron, something ancient is watching.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pick your skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three core skills. Each one shapes how you see the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/acc0fa7906c13ab37c813b49eb4abfb6.poster.avif?t=1754841595\" width=806 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/acc0fa7906c13ab37c813b49eb4abfb6.webm?t=1754841595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/acc0fa7906c13ab37c813b49eb4abfb6.mp4?t=1754841595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become The Recycler</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn what you were built for, and why someone tried to destroy you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/a64525af8b48ebe488c55bcfc6e13812.poster.avif?t=1754841595\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/a64525af8b48ebe488c55bcfc6e13812.webm?t=1754841595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/a64525af8b48ebe488c55bcfc6e13812.mp4?t=1754841595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use the Listening Device</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap into hidden thoughts and memories. Track signals to your next destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/7e436d90942707eb29f49187b85bfdb1.poster.avif?t=1754841595\" width=806 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/7e436d90942707eb29f49187b85bfdb1.webm?t=1754841595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/7e436d90942707eb29f49187b85bfdb1.mp4?t=1754841595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover more through Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate side quests scattered across the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
